t



Otherwise the backtest becomes fictional.



32. Transaction costs


If you ignore costs, a high-frequency strategy can appear enormously profitable.


The simulation should include:



Cost =
Commission+
Spread+
Slippage



Then:



R_{realistic}
=
R_{gross}-Cost



This frequently changes the results dramatically.



